    rdfs:comment "Specifies the events elected by the parties that are deemed an Access Condition (for Initial Margin CSA) or a Specified Condition (for Variation Margin and Legacy CSA), which, if triggered, may temporarily or permanently suspend rights to rehypothecate, transfer, or substitute collateral." ;
    skos:altLabel "specified condition or access condition" .

<https://cdm.finos.org/model/cdm.legaldocumentation.csa.TerminationCurrencyElection> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "TerminationCurrencyElection" ;
    rdfs:comment "A class to specify the Amendment to Termination Currency election by the parties to the agreement." ;
